<title>USA: Eutro Group president/COO resigns.</title>
<headline>Eutro Group president/COO resigns.</headline>
<dateline>JUPITER, Fla. 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eutro Group Holding Inc said on Thursday Albert Shackleton resigned as director, president and chief operating officer of the company.</p>
<p>Shackleton resigned to focus on real estate development, the company said. He will remain president and chief executive of Eutro's subsidiary, WEB Investment Builders Inc.</p>
<p>The company was not available to comment on who might succeed Shackelton as president and COO.</p>
</text>
